A standard partner request can include up to 50 cities.
If demand and coverage justify it, larger territories may be considered.

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section id="appliances">

<h2>Appliances Commonly Requested</h2>

<div class="grid">

<div class="card">
<h3>Washers</h3>
<p>
Top-load, front-load and stackable washing machines.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Dryers</h3>
<p>
Electric and gas dryers, including washer and dryer sets.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Refrigerators</h3>
<p>
Top-freezer, side-by-side, French-door and other full-size refrigerators.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Stoves & Ranges</h3>
<p>
Major electric and gas stoves and ranges.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Freezers</h3>
<p>
Upright and chest freezers that qualify for pickup.
</p>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<section>

<h2>Who We Are Looking For</h2>

<div class="grid">

<div class="card">
<h3>Reliable Operators</h3>
<p>
People who can respond to customers and complete pickups professionally.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Appliance Resellers</h3>
<p>
Independent appliance sellers who can handle additional pickup opportunities.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Pickup Trucks & Trailers</h3>
<p>
Operators with suitable pickup trucks, trailers, cargo vans or similar equipment.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Consistent Coverage</h3>
<p>
Partners who can reliably service the cities included in their approved territory.
</p>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<section id="apply">

<h2>Apply to Become a Partner</h2>

<p>
Complete the information below.
Your selected cities will automatically be copied into the requested territory field.
</p>

<form
id="partnerForm"
action="mailto:freereliableappliancepickup@gmail.com"
method="post"
enctype="text/plain">

<div class="apply-grid">

<div>

<label for="name">
Full Name *
</label>

<input
id="name"
name="Full Name"
required
>

</div>

<div>

<label for="phone">
Phone Number *
</label>

<input
id="phone"
name="Phone Number"
type="tel"
required
>

</div>

<div>

<label for="email">
Email Address *
</label>

<input
id="email"
name="Email Address"
type="email"
required
>

</div>

<div>

<label for="business">
Business Name
</label>

<input
id="business"
name="Business Name"
>

</div>

<div>

<label for="primaryState">
Primary State *
</label>

<input
id="primaryState"
name="Primary State"
required
>

</div>

<div>

<label for="primaryCity">
Primary City *
</label>

<input
id="primaryCity"
name="Primary City"
required
>

</div>

<div>

<label for="vehicle">
Vehicle / Equipment
</label>

<select
id="vehicle"
name="Vehicle / Equipment">

<option value="">
Choose one
</option>

<option>
Pickup truck
</option>

<option>
Pickup truck and trailer
</option>

<option>
Cargo van
</option>

<option>
Box truck
</option>

<option>
Multiple vehicles
</option>

<option>
Other
</option>

</select>

</div>

<div>

<label for="experience">
Appliance Pickup Experience
</label>

<select
id="experience"
name="Appliance Pickup Experience">

<option value="">
Choose one
</option>

<option>
New to appliance pickup
</option>

<option>
Less than 1 year
</option>

<option>
1–3 years
</option>

<option>
3–5 years
</option>

<option>
5+ years
</option>

</select>

</div>

<div class="full">

<label for="territoryField">
Requested Cities / Territory *
</label>

<textarea
id="territoryField"
name="Requested Cities / Territory"
required
placeholder="Select cities above or type your territory here."></textarea>

</div>

<div class="full">

<label for="notes">
Additional Information
</label>

<textarea
id="notes"
name="Additional Information"
placeholder="Tell us about your operation, schedule, service radius or anything else we should know."></textarea>

</div>

<div class="full checkbox-row">

<input
id="agree"
name="Agreement"
value="Yes"
type="checkbox"
required
>

<label for="agree">
I understand that applying does not guarantee approval,
leads, exclusivity or territory availability.
</label>

</div>

<div class="full">

<button
class="submit"
type="submit">
Send Partner Application
</button>

</div>

</div>

</form>

<div class="notice">

<strong>Important:</strong>

Partner approval, lead volume and territory availability depend on
local demand, service quality, current coverage and other business factors.

</div>

</section>

</main>

<footer>

<p>
<strong>
Free Reliable Appliance Pickup
</strong>
</p>

<p>
Appliance pickup services and partner opportunities across the United States.
</p>

<p>
<a href="../">
Return to Homepage
</a>
</p>

</footer>

